/* =============================================================================
   scrSubmissions -> OnVisible   (screen property: paste into the formula bar)

   Same access rule as scrOverview: admins see everyone, line managers their
   reportees only, anyone else is sent back to the landing page. This screen
   must not assume scrOverview was visited first, so it re-checks.
   The data build is btnRefreshSubs.OnSelect - identical to
   btnRefreshOverview.OnSelect on scrOverview (paste/admin-rebuild.powerfx).
   ============================================================================ */
/* SHAPE MATTERS. Studio refuses a Navigate in OnVisible unless it is the
   whole of an If branch - If(condition, Navigate(screen)), the form every
   other screen's OnVisible uses. Chaining it with anything else in the same
   branch ("Navigate(...); Notify(...)") is rejected with "Navigate cannot be
   used here since it would automatically always navigate away from this
   screen". So the refusal is three separate Ifs, Notify before Navigate. */
Set(varIsLineManager, Not IsBlank(LookUp('RolePreference People', LineManagerEmail = varUserEmail).EmployeeID));
If(varIsAdmin Or varIsLineManager, Set(varSelectedOverviewId, Blank()); Select(btnRefreshSubs));
If(Not (varIsAdmin Or varIsLineManager), Notify("The admin pages are only available to Aurora admins and line managers.", NotificationType.Error));
If(Not (varIsAdmin Or varIsLineManager), Navigate(scrLanding))
